{"term": {"label": "心", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "加", "id": "加"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "害", "id": "害"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "心", "variants": [], "id": "心"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "教", "id": "敎"}, {"form": "正", "id": "正"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "盡", "id": "盡"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "門", "id": "門"}, {"form": "飢渴", "id": "飢渴"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.386466576974748, "source": "禮", "target": "盡"}, {"weight": 1.13370360847938, "source": "禮", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.2878542883066382, "source": "禮", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.9810014688665833, "source": "禮", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.826850789039325, "source": "禮", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.6933193964148026, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.386466576974748, "source": "禮", "target": "用"}, {"weight": 3.079613757534693, "source": "禮", "target": "門"}, {"weight": 2.5199979695992702, "source": "天", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.2078115806331018, "source": "天", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 0.648195792697679, "source": "人", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 0.5740878205439571, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.322773392263051, "source": "人", "target": "存"}, {"weight": 1.421385680931161, "source": "人", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 1.421385